top to bottom direction
actor Teacher
rectangle "StudyFlow — Teacher" #7ACFF5 {
usecase "Tạo / quản lý\nCourse Offering" as course
usecase "Quản lý join code" as code
usecase "Duyệt / từ chối\nyêu cầu tham gia" as enrollment
usecase "Quản lý thành viên lớp" as members
usecase "Upload Course Material PDF" as upload
usecase "Theo dõi xử lý PDF" as processing
usecase "Công bố học liệu" as publish
usecase "Thu hồi công bố" as revoke
usecase "Tạo Quiz AI từ PDF" as generate
usecase "Review / chỉnh sửa Quiz" as review
usecase "Publish Quiz cho lớp" as publishQuiz
course -[hidden]down-> code
code -[hidden]down-> enrollment
enrollment -[hidden]down-> members
upload -[hidden]down-> processing
processing -[hidden]down-> publish
publish -[hidden]down-> revoke
revoke -[hidden]down-> generate
generate -[hidden]down-> review
review -[hidden]down-> publishQuiz
members -[hidden]down-> upload
}
Teacher -right- course
Teacher -[norank]- code
Teacher -[norank]- enrollment
Teacher -[norank]- members
Teacher -[norank]- upload
Teacher -[norank]- processing
Teacher -[norank]- publish
Teacher -[norank]- revoke
Teacher -[norank]- generate
Teacher -[norank]- review
Teacher -[norank]- publishQuiz
note bottom of publish
Chỉ quản lý lớp/học liệu thuộc Teacher.
PDF READY mới được công bố hoặc dùng tạo Quiz.
Teacher không có chatbot hoặc AI Tutor.
Upload, công bố và thu hồi là các mục tiêu độc lập.
end note
@enduml
